        "summary": "In Mystic Heroes, it's up to you to find hidden Runes that will help you defeat an enemy army. As one of four main characters, you'll battle through Mt. Hoshin, Mt. Senkai, and The City of the Ancients. In each stage, you must equip your Runes strategically in order to defeat powerful enemies and bosses. The more Runes you gather, the more spells you unlock and levels you advance. There are 70 total Runes hidden throughout the single-player missions and multiplayer modes.",
        "cover_url": null,
        "release_date": 1020038400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)",
        "platform_ids": "24",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/magical-houshin",
        "cached_at": 1772527922
      },
      {
        "id": 49708,
        "name": "Magi Nation",
        "summary": "Based on the Magi Nation collectible trading card game.\n\nMagi Nation is a collectible card game developed and published by Interactive Imagination for the Gameboy Color.\n\nWhat would you do if you found yourself in a strange land, face-to-face with a mysterious presence and catapulted into an adventure to save an entire civilization? Well, find out! Explore a world of color and imagination that will challenge your every notion of reality. Experience the rush of dueling a Shadow Magi, with everything on the line. Find yourself going toe-to-toe with the awesome Timber Hyren, or the gargantuan Ormagon. Be the savior of an entire civilization. And find uses for jellybeans that you never thought possible.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co5ns4.jpg",
        "release_date": 984614400,
