        "summary": "If you know Pokemon Mystery Dungeon Series of Nintendo, this game style is the same as that series. You are Pikachu and have to rescue other Pokemon that need helps.\n\nOn your 12th birthday, a strange aura came in your room. You are in a deep sleep. When you wake up, you see Torchic and Chikorita. But you can not believe that they call you Pikachu and you are now a Pokemon. You are so confused but then two Pokemon offer you to join their Rescue Team. And so begins your journey.",
