      {
        "id": 135599,
        "name": "The Last Promise",
        "summary": "The Last Promise is an elaborate mod of Fire Emblem 7: Blazing Sword, casually referred to as just \"Fire Emblem\" in North America. The game hacks pretty much every concept that you could possibly think of--characters, classes, weapons, animations, graphics, maps, music, text, script, etc., you get the point. While this is no longer a big deal, when it was started many years ago, it was a relatively novel concept to mod many aspects of the game at once.",
