      {
        "id": 233604,
        "name": "Fire Emblem: Binding Blade Plus",
        "summary": "The goal of this project is to take all the amazing hacks from the Fire Emblem GBA hacking community and put them into the base game experience. These are designed for veteran players and newcomers alike! The changes are designed to be uncontroversial enough so that this isn’t seen as an “alternate” way to play the game but an “enhanced” way. The major changes are QOL and bugfixes. The only gameplay changes come from removing localization changes.\n\nHere are the changes present in all versions:\n\nAdds Casual Mode\nUnlocks Hard Mode at start\nPrevent Misheal bug\nFimbulvetr glitch fix",
        "cover_url": null,
