        "cached_at": 1772527922
      },
      {
        "id": 242994,
        "name": "Disney's Extreme Skate Adventure",
        "summary": "The portable version of the game Disney's Extreme Skate Adventure. The Game Boy Advance version moves to an isometric viewpoint, using the engine of the portable Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 4.\n\nThree worlds are included: Toy Story, Tarzan, and The Lion King, each with two levels and a boss fight. In the story mode, each level has 3 runs, each one unlocking more of the level. Characters are scattered around the level, and will give missions, for example making a difficult jump, or collecting items within a time limit. There are also time challenge (most points inside a time limit), trick challenge (match tricks), and turbo challenge (match kinds of tricks fast) modes for each level, along with a tutorial and versus mode. In versus mode, two players take turns (hot-seat) getting the best trick possible.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6b65.jpg",
        "release_date": 1062547200,
        "rating": null,
