        "summary": "An Italian rom hack based on Pokémon Ruby filled with obscene humor.\n\nYou play an old man who, having turned 10, sets out on his journey with Pokémon. He will meet countless characters, and find himself saving the world by having RAI abolish the program \"La Melevisione\" , hosted by the now feared Pokémon trainer Tonio Cartonio, who together with his gang wants to take over the world.",
