      {
        "id": 276343,
        "name": "Pokémon Procyon and Deneb",
        "summary": "A ROM hack of Pokémon FireRed and a sequel to Pokémon Vega. It aims to be a completely original fan-made Pokémon experience, featuring the brand new region of Setoguni, over 100 new Pokémon including new evolutions of official Pokémon, new moves and mechanics, and a new storyline.\n\nIts most recent beta was released on April 1st, 2018, and the project has been in indefinite hiatus ever since.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7d1j.jpg",
