      },
      {
        "id": 276893,
        "name": "Pokémon verde musgo",
        "summary": "Have you ever imagined traveling across two continents and their provinces? Go by rocket to Mars? How about visiting the city of Prypiat and the famous Chernobyl plant? Fight crime and the terrible Illuminatis? Walking across a continent completely dominated by a criminal organization? Meet eccentric personalities, such as: Captain Nascimento, Elton John, Harry Potter, Hercules, Master Yoda, Al Capone, the living dead in the Pet Cemetery, etc.?\n\nYes, now you can! VERDE MOSS, a fantastic hack, with all available Pokémon, 135 new moves, where the player takes on the role of a police officer disguised as a trainer and investigates criminal organizations across the continents of Ruroro and Urara.\n\nA long game, with a high level of difficulty, with several post-games, extras, missions, events from the creators (in the style of Nintendo events), completely new events and others based on films, special battle towers, with prizes, in addition to of two world tournaments.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7dl6.jpg",
        "release_date": 1568678400,
