      {
        "id": 300329,
        "name": "Pokémon Odyssey",
        "summary": "Embark on a perilous journey into the Yggdrasil Labyrinth, a colossal desert maze on Talrega Island rumored to hold untold treasures or lost civilizations. As Nyx, a new guild recruit, your quest to unravel its depths takes a disastrous turn, transforming exploration into a desperate fight for survival and truth within the enigmatic roots of the world tree.\n\nThis story-driven Pokémon adventure ditches gyms and evil teams for pure dungeon crawling! Experience double battles, resource gathering, FOE evasion, and naval exploration. Enjoy deep customization: all Pokémon have perfect IVs, EVs are managed via items, and natures/abilities can be changed. Explore Gen 1-3 with new Etrian Variants, side quests, and a rebalanced, grind-free experience focused on strategic depth.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/coa4fx.jpg",
