      {
        "id": 352245,
        "name": "Pokémon Recharged Pink",
        "summary": "Pokémon Recharged Pink is a fully completed GBA ROM hack made by Jaizu, and a sister release to Pokémon Recharged Yellow. Embark on an exciting journey through a more challenging Kanto region, redesigned in the Generation 3 style. Hang out with your buddy Pikachu, have fun with the Pokémon you meet, collect gym badges, and take on Team Rocket, featuring Jessie, James, and Meowth.\nThis is, functionally, the same game as Pokémon Recharged Yellow but with some extra changes for people that don't mind about compatibility with generation 3 games. This version gives up things like connectivity to other games for features like a dedicated cheat menu available in the player's PC.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/coa2gw.jpg",
        "release_date": 1726099200,
