        "id": 353274,
        "name": "Pokémon Edición Team Rocket",
        "summary": "Pokémon Edición Team Rocket is a full-length ROM hack of Pokémon FireRed developed by Dragonsden. Unlike traditional Pokémon games, this fan-made adventure puts the player in the role of a Team Rocket grunt, offering a completely new storyline, characters, and objectives.\n\nSet in the Kanto region, the game features custom events, modified maps, unique dialogues, and original gameplay progression. Later versions include access to the Sevii Islands and even the Johto region, making it a large-scale expansion with dozens of hours of new content.\n\nThe game is entirely in Spanish and is one of the most ambitious Team Rocket-themed hacks available. It is not affiliated with Nintendo or Game Freak, and is intended for non-commercial, fan-made purposes only.",
