        "summary": "Pokémon: Dreamstone Mysteries is a fan-made RPG that drops players into the unexplored region of Cormoria. The place is packed with wild environments—think freezing peaks, lava-filled craters, and shadowy wetlands. The goal? Track down the missing Professor Tenebris while fending off Team Somber, a shady group after the powerful Dreamstones.\n\nThis isn’t just another Pokémon game. The story digs deeper, mixing classic monster-catching with mystery and exploration. There are around 300 Pokémon from different generations, plus smoother battles and cleaner visuals. Whether you’re new or a longtime player, it blends nostalgia with fresh twists.",
